# After the murder: fear, names called into the dark, grief.

== where_is_jory
priority: 1
when: missing(Jory)
cast: A = any; B? = any
cooldown: once
A: Jory? Jory, this isn't funny.
B [whispers]: Stay behind me.

== missing_where
priority: 1
when: missing
cast: A = any; B? = any
cooldown: 1m
again: yes
A: Where's {dead} got to?
B: Asleep in the shed, likely. Go and look.

# Grief by name, for each tie (TalkDirector.grieve): A the man who knew him.

== grief_jory_osric
when: dead(Jory)
cast: A = kin(Jory); B? = any
cooldown: once
priority: 10
A [shouts]: Jory! No. No, no, no...
B: Osric, come away. He's gone.
A {if rash}: I'll open him like a sack!
A: Find him. Find him for me.

== grief_osric_jory
when: dead(Osric)
cast: A = kin(Osric); B? = any
cooldown: once
priority: 10
A [shouts]: Osric! Get up! Get up, damn you!
B: He's gone, lad. Stay down.

== grief_col_piers
when: dead(Col)
cast: A = friend(Col); B? = any
cooldown: once
priority: 10
A [shouts]: Col? Col! Oh gods, oh gods...
B: Quiet! You want to be next?

== grief_piers_col
when: dead(Piers)
cast: A = friend(Piers); B? = any
cooldown: once
priority: 10
A: Piers... you owed me three pennies, you fool.
B: Leave him. Leave him!

== grief_ned_hendrik
when: dead(Ned)
cast: A = friend(Ned); B? = any
cooldown: once
priority: 10
A [shouts]: Ned! Two weeks in. Two weeks!
B: Hendrik, he's gone.

== grief_hendrik_ned
when: dead(Hendrik)
cast: A = friend(Hendrik); B? = any
cooldown: once
priority: 10
A [shouts]: Hendrik? No... who'll tell his girl?
B: We will. After. Get up.

# Fear.

== fear_count_heads
priority: 1
when: dread>=0.35
cast: A = any; B = any
cooldown: 3m
group: dread
A [whispers]: Count heads. Who's still here?
B: Not enough of us.

== fear_lantern_out
priority: 1
when: dread>=0.35, alarm>=0.45
cast: A = craven; B = any
cooldown: 3m
A [whispers]: Keep the lantern up. Please.
B: It's up. It's up. Breathe.
